1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Two care staff open the same saved note.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Session A starts typing into its own
draft.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,714
Session B edits the same note and saves
first.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,414
Session A is warned before it can
overwrite anything.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,900
Version conflict: nothing was silently
merged.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,971
The losing draft is kept beside the latest
saved note.

7
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,400
No automatic merge was applied. A person
decides.
